00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.220
and then that's it.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.290
So pretty simple preprocessing.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.810
I would expect that a
bigger data, perhaps,

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:25.080
would do more things.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:28.430
And so, we can see
that our data--

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.570
apparently, I didn't
