00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:40.340
And our input function here
is pretty straightforward.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:44.500
It takes our raw data, and
if we want it to be shuffled,

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.630
we can call a shuffle
on our data set.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.900
And I just let it repeat and
batch into chunks as needed.

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.530
And so, this will just feed
