00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:36.206
And so, each of these arrays
represent a batch of data.

00:20:36.206 --> 00:20:37.830
And I was also playing
around with this

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.560
to check out the unique
values for each column just

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.722
to make sure that most of
