00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:57.050
And TensorFlow uses this
notion of feature columns

00:20:57.050 --> 00:21:00.020
to represent the incoming data.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.590
Models are pretty generic, and
so, by using feature columns,

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:06.770
it allows you to customize it
for your particular dataset.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:10.250
In our case, I just loop over
