00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:20.390
to let TensorFlow know how
many columns and of what type

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:23.300
are coming in.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.810
So we'll run that.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.840
And if things break,
